"Brief bench driver for the FEATURE MATRIX sweep (scripts/matrix-bench.sh).
 Deliberately shorter than cog-bench.mst's rigorous protocol: 10 warmup + 9
 samples, median + min only. This is an INDICATOR harness — it answers 'does
 this combination move anything, and which way', cheaply enough to sweep a
 dozen configurations. Anything it flags gets re-measured with the full
 41-sample cog-bench protocol before it is believed. Checksums are still
 verified on every run: a fast wrong answer is worse than no answer.
 MACVM-only (no Cog/MACDART interleave — this compares MACVM against itself)."
Object subclass: MatrixRun [
    MatrixRun class >> run: name block: aBlock check: want [
        | times t0 r sorted n med mn |
        r := aBlock value.
        r = want ifFalse: [
            Transcript showCr: name, ' WRONG ', r printString.
            Smalltalk quit: 1 ].
        25 timesRepeat: [ r := aBlock value ].
        times := OrderedCollection new.
        9 timesRepeat: [
            t0 := Smalltalk microsecondClock.
            r := aBlock value.
            times add: Smalltalk microsecondClock - t0 ].
        r = want ifFalse: [
            Transcript showCr: name, ' WRONG ', r printString.
            Smalltalk quit: 1 ].
        sorted := times asSortedCollection asArray.
        n := sorted size.
        med := sorted at: (n + 1) // 2.
        mn := sorted first.
        Transcript showCr: name, ' warm_us=', med printString, ' min_us=', mn printString
    ]
    "The responsive subset: fib/richards/deltablue/sieve/dict all moved under
     the Stage 1-2 changes. arith is excluded (its prologue runs once per
     benchmark, so per-activation work is invisible to it — proven by an
     opcode-identical disassembly); alloc is excluded as the noisiest row."
    MatrixRun class >> runAll [
        self run: 'fib      ' block: [ BenchmarkDashboard benchFib ]       check: 2178309.
        self run: 'richards ' block: [ BenchmarkDashboard benchRichards ]  check: 2324609297.
        self run: 'deltablue' block: [ BenchmarkDashboard benchDeltaBlue ] check: 224874.
        self run: 'sieve    ' block: [ BenchmarkDashboard benchSieve ]     check: 1899.
        self run: 'dict     ' block: [ BenchmarkDashboard benchDict ]      check: 170698668000.
    ]
]
MatrixRun runAll.
